    <MudCard Class="pa-6 about-card" Elevation="0">

        <MudText Typo="Typo.h4" Style="color:white;" GutterBottom="true">
            About Genstar Paint Trade Center
        </MudText>

        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1"
                 Style="line-height:1.8;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);">

            Genstar Paint Trade Center was founded by Mr. Sonny Cariño Chong in 1998.
            He first established the business along Magsaysay Avenue, General Santos City
            (beside Mitchy's Car Accessories).

            <br /><br />

            At its early stage, the company focused on automotive paints with a 75:25 ratio
            of Car Paints to House Paints. It became the first dealer of Dupont Paints
            (now Cromax) in the SOCKSARGEN area.

            <br /><br />

            Over the years, the business expanded into house, marine, and industrial paints,
            shifting to a 60:40 product ratio while maintaining its manual mixing tradition.

